    "negative_clarification": "Credit-claiming does NOT occur when a senator merely states a position, critiques another entity, or discusses a policy without explicitly or implicitly tying it to their personal actions or contributions. It also does not include general statements of support, announcements of others' actions, or purely informational releases.",
